# quality-mgr, 2026-09-06, phase-aw-gate-closeout-qa (PR #1254 @ 6345ce7fd):
# rebuild_received_hook_dispatch no longer loads the message itself -- it now
# takes `message: &Message` as a parameter. The load moved to a dedicated
# caller-side step (load_received_hook_dispatch_message, nudge_dispatch.rs:
# 78-88), invoked from queue_drain.rs's claim_next_dispatch via its own
# `run_blocking("load queued message dispatch", ...)` call, separate from
# the writer's claim. Independently confirmed by req-qa, rust-qa-agent, and
# arch-qa in the same round; exactly one load_message call site remains in
# nudge_dispatch.rs (inside load_received_hook_dispatch_message itself).
